      "created": 1795309661855,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "First repo on github was created during October 2007 (I was like 1 year old back then.)     That is the point from when we have to\nstart indexing each repo with a topic, till current date time.\nThere are thousands of repositories created between this timeline. But, GitHub has a limit of 1000 repositories per search query.",
      "fontSize": 16.946138122909854,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "First repo on github was created during October 2007 (I was like 1 year old back then.)     That is the point from when we have to start indexing each repo with a topic, till current date time.\nThere are thousands of repositories created between this timeline. But, GitHub has a limit of 1000 repositories per search query.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
